				4
			],
			"Message": "style(Mist): Apply consistent formatting to DNS server and zone modules\n\nReformat `Server.rs`, `Zone.rs`, and integration tests to align with Rust formatting standards. Consolidate multi-line function calls and argument lists onto single lines where width permits, and reflow comment blocks to wrap cleanly at 100 characters.\n\nImport ordering in `tests/integration.rs` was normalized to match the project's alphabetical sorting convention for module items. These changes are cosmetic only, ensuring the codebase maintains visual consistency without altering runtime behavior or logic.\n\nThis aligns with the recent workbench-lift cycle focused on naming and formatting standards.",
			"SHA": "7ada86ef8ee68427931ac254cf956ad332f5df20"
		},
